WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:10.942
Seeds don't have feet or wings.

2
00:00:10.943 --> 00:00:14.127
But some seeds can travel.

3
00:00:14.128 --> 00:00:16.623
This is a dandelion seed.

4
00:00:16.624 --> 00:00:19.600
How does this seed travel?

5
00:00:19.601 --> 00:00:22.336
The wind helps this seed travel.

6
00:00:22.337 --> 00:00:26.495
"Whee! Farther! Farther!"

7
00:00:26.496 --> 00:00:29.038
This is a willow tree seed.

8
00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:32.960
How does this seed travel?

9
00:00:32.961 --> 00:00:36.007
The river helps this seed travel.

10
00:00:36.008 --> 00:00:39.251
"Watch me float!"

11
00:00:39.252 --> 00:00:41.436
This is a cherry seed.

12
00:00:41.437 --> 00:00:44.620
How does this seed travel?

13
00:00:44.621 --> 00:00:47.567
The bird helps this seed travel.

14
00:00:47.568 --> 00:00:54.594
The bird's poop carries the seed to the ground.

15
00:00:54.595 --> 00:00:57.061
This is a sunflower seed.

16
00:00:57.062 --> 00:00:59.837
How does this seed travel?

17
00:00:59.838 --> 00:01:03.405
The rain helps this seed fall to the ground.

18
00:01:03.406 --> 00:01:07.734
"Look out! Get out of my way!"

19
00:01:07.735 --> 00:01:10.178
This is an impatiens seed.

20
00:01:10.179 --> 00:01:13.363
How does this seed travel?

21
00:01:13.364 --> 00:01:17.195
This seed pops onto the ground.

22
00:01:17.196 --> 00:01:20.986
"I am an acrobat!"

23
00:01:20.987 --> 00:01:23.739
This is a Spanish needles seed.

24
00:01:23.740 --> 00:01:26.599
How does this seed travel?

25
00:01:26.600 --> 00:01:28.949
People help this seed travel.

26
00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:34.762
This seed sticks to the girl's sweater. "Ouch!"

27
00:01:34.763 --> 00:01:38.108
Some seeds are really good travelers.

28
00:01:38.109 --> 00:01:44.530
"Thank you for the ride!"
